  "default_direction": "en_to_pl",
  "note": "A2 liść · rides past_byc / bedzie / miec_acc / present_am. a1_work already owns praca, biuro, firma, szef, spotkanie, pensja, pieniądze, kolega z pracy, pracownik, menedżer, kariera, biznes, rozmowa kwalifikacyjna, pracować, zaczynać, kończyć, przerwa — and the pool also already owns klient, zarabiać/zarabiam and urlop. All of those are ANCHORS here, never re-taught. This pack teaches 11 new employment words plus the -am paradigm of szukać, and the payoff is talking about a working life over time: Szukam pracy · Będę szukać pracy · Tata był bezrobotny. Kept strictly to EMPLOYMENT so it does not overlap a2_school2 (studying). szkolenie is claimed here as workplace training; wykład went to school2. doświadczenie and szukać are general words assigned here because their first useful collocations are doświadczenie w pracy and szukam pracy. zwolnienie was dropped: it means both a dismissal and a doctor's sick note, and a two-sense noun breaks the one-unknown rule; premia took its place. zarobki is plural-only — always są, never jest, and no plural past exists in the pool. No copular future anywhere (będę w pracy is not expressible yet); będę appears only with a bare infinitive. Adjectives take no gender badge.",
